= Install Iosevka

Parametric high-density mono. Not the DevCentr terminal default.

Same file on every OS. PlayTime binds `cli.install` for tool `iosevka`.

::: playbook [id="install-iosevka" shell="auto"]

::: choose [id="pkg-format" prompt="How should we install Iosevka?" intent="cli.install" tool="iosevka"]
:::

::: step [id="install" intent="cli.install" tool="iosevka" bind="pkg-format" confirm=true]
:::

:::
